      "site_admin": false
    },
    "created_at": "2016-04-07T09:46:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-07T09:46:04Z",
    "body": "I think I agree with @Ms2ger. It would mean `setAttribute()` would not throw and the value would be set as-is, but it would not work either since it never got compiled. So far `setAttribute()` has remained clean from any special cases and it seems nice to preserve that.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
